      "source": "Gateway to $function and $accumulator aggregation operations. <br/>\nUsing <a href=\"ScriptOperators.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ScriptOperators</code></a> as part of the <a href=\"Aggregation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Aggregation</code></a> requires MongoDB server to have\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/core/server-side-javascript/\">server-side JavaScript</a> execution\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/reference/configuration-options/#security.javascriptEnabled\">enabled</a>.",
      "translation": "$function 和 $accumulator 聚合操作的入口。<br/>\n使用 <a href=\"ScriptOperators.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ScriptOperators</code></a> 作为 <a href=\"Aggregation.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>Aggregation</code></a> 的一部分，需要 MongoDB 服务器已启用\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/core/server-side-javascript/\">服务端 JavaScript</a> 执行功能\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/reference/configuration-options/#security.javascriptEnabled\">（已开启）</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ScriptOperators.Accumulator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ScriptOperators.Accumulator</code></a> defines a custom aggregation\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/reference/operator/aggregation/accumulator/\">$accumulator operator</a>,\none that maintains its state (e.g. totals, maximums, minimums, and related data) as documents progress through the\npipeline, in JavaScript.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ScriptOperators.Accumulator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ScriptOperators.Accumulator</code></a> 定义了一个自定义聚合 <a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/reference/operator/aggregation/accumulator/\">$accumulator 运算符</a>，该运算符在 JavaScript 中维护其状态（例如总计、最大值、最小值及相关数据），随着文档在管道中的处理而更新。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"ScriptOperators.Function.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ScriptOperators.Function</code></a> defines a custom aggregation\n<a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/reference/operator/aggregation/function/\">$function</a> in JavaScript.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"ScriptOperators.Function.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.aggregation\"><code>ScriptOperators.Function</code></a> 定义了一个自定义聚合 <a href=\"https://docs.mongodb.com/master/reference/operator/aggregation/function/\">$function</a>，该函数在 JavaScript 中运行。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
